cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use SynthRAN in research, please cite the exact software version or
  Git commit used for the experiment.
title: SynthRAN
type: software
version: 0.1.0
authors:
  - name: SynthRAN contributors
abstract: >-
  SynthRAN is research software for configuring, provisioning, verifying, and
  recording reproducible virtual and physical 5G testbeds, with an evolving
  scientific experiment layer built on accepted deployments.
repository-code: https://github.com/RA-Nayreed/SynthRAN
url: https://github.com/RA-Nayreed/SynthRAN
keywords:
  - 5G
  - research software
  - RAN
  - R2Lab
  - reproducibility
license: BSD-3-Clause
